  ('d32','Benzylpenicillin (Penicillin G)','Crystapen','Natural penicillin','Severe streptococcal infections, meningitis, syphilis, endocarditis, tetanus, gas gangrene','Hypersensitivity/anaphylaxis, rash, Jarisch-Herxheimer reaction, seizures at very high doses','Probenecid (increased levels), methotrexate, aminoglycosides (do not mix in same syringe)','Penicillin hypersensitivity','Adults: 1.2-2.4 g (2-4 MU) every 4-6 hours IV. Meningitis: higher doses per protocol. Children/neonates: weight- and age-based dosing.','B','US-FDA (legacy)',0,0,'WHO EML 2023; Ghana STG 2017 (AI-drafted — pending pharmacist review)','https://list.essentialmeds.org/',NULL,NULL),
