  ('d53','Simvastatin','Zocor, Simvor','HMG-CoA reductase inhibitor (statin)','Hypercholesterolemia, cardiovascular risk reduction','Myalgia, raised liver enzymes, rhabdomyolysis (dose-related), GI upset','Amlodipine/diltiazem/verapamil (dose limits), macrolides, azoles, grapefruit, fibrates','Active liver disease, pregnancy, breastfeeding, concurrent potent CYP3A4 inhibitors','Adults: 20-40 mg once daily at night. Max 20 mg with amlodipine/diltiazem/verapamil. Avoid grapefruit juice.','X','US-FDA (legacy)',0,0,'WHO EML 2023; Ghana STG 2017 (AI-drafted — pending pharmacist review)','https://list.essentialmeds.org/',NULL,NULL),
